{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|Raider's Cap}}

A piece of Hard Leather [[armor]] . Equips to 1L.

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{_{q}Hardened Leather+ _{q}Metal}{2}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Sewing}</math>.

==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
!Stat
!Formula
